1	1	Path to the Wizard's Keep	This is a simple path. To the north, the Wizard's Keep can be seen, a majestic\n\n\nplace for adepts. A dense forest can be seen below.\n\n\n	16384	11
2	1	Path to Keep	The path continues on, stretching north towards the Wizard's Keep. Birds can\n\n\nbe heard all around, and the sun shines brightly. Little can be seen of\n\n\nanything to the sides of the path, the forest so dense that you cannot see a\n\n\nthing. The smell of the forest is overwhelming.\n\n\n	0	11
3	1	Path to Keep	The path continues on, stretching north towards the Wizard's Keep. Birds can\n\n\nbe heard all around, and the sun shines brightly. Little can be seen of\n\n\nanything to the sides of the path, the forest so dense that you cannot see a\n\n\nthing. A faint scent of smoke wafts in from the east.\n\n\n	4	11
4	1	Road to Keep	The road widens here as it approaches the Keep from the south. Worn cobblestones\n\n\nline the path, smoothed by years of marching boots. A faint shimmer of magic\n\n\nlingers in the air, and the Keep's imposing silhouette looms just to the north.\n\n\n	0	11
5	1	Path around the Keep	To the west and the east, a path around the keep stretches. To the north, you\n\n\ncan see a moat that is completely impassable. To the south, a dense forest\n\n\ngrows, of which only trees can be seen. The sun shines brightly above, giving\n\n\nan almost cheerful feeling to the area.\n\n\n	0	11
