259	2	@@dThe Catacomb Lord's Antechamber@@N	A formal antechamber outside the Catacomb Lord's throne room. The\ndecor here is precise: symmetrical arrangements of bones, carefully\nplaced void-candles, and a carpet of dark fabric that muffles sound\ncompletely. The impression is of a court carefully maintained, not\nabandoned. Someone has been here recently.\n	8201	11
