292	2	@@cThe Eternal Corridors Entrance@@N	A passage that branches from the main citadel's upper level leads to\nthe Eternal Corridors - a section of Kel'Shadra built according to\ndifferent geometric rules than the rest. The corridors here loop and\nbranch in ways that violate normal space; careful mapping consistently\nproduces maps that disagree with themselves. The Corridor Warden\nmaintains this impossibility as a feature, not a flaw.\n	8201	11
