65312	45	@@WThe Halls of the Staff@@N	You stand in a grand hall reserved for the immortal staff of this realm. @@WShimmering pillars@@N of pure energy line the chamber, and a sense of absolute peace pervades the air.	148492	11
65315	45	@@WThe Builder's Workshop@@N	An immaculate workspace where the architects of the realm craft new wonders. Tools and blueprints cover every surface, and the air hums with creative energy.	148492	11
65323	45	@@WThe Morgue@@N	A stark, cold room where the fallen are brought to rest. Stone slabs line the walls, and the air carries the chill of finality.	1036	11
65324	45	@@WThe Moribund Ward@@N	A place between life and death, where souls linger on the threshold. The air shimmers faintly with residual energy.	1036	11
65325	45	@@WThe Clan Hall@@N	A grand meeting hall where clan leaders gather to counsel and strategize. Banners of the great clans hang from the vaulted ceiling.	148492	11
65326	45	@@WThe Donation Hall@@N	A spacious hall where adventurers leave unwanted goods for others in need. Shelves line the walls, offering a variety of useful items.	1036	11
