237	sap_transfusion	0	sap transfusion	You channel your own life force into another, transferring HP\nat a 1:1 ratio. Cannot be cast on yourself.\nDruid spell. Uses HP instead of mana and builds Overgrowth.\n
21	ushabti	0	Ushabti	Animated stone carved from the Great Pyramid's quarry zones and given consciousness by\nthe Solar Court's Seal College, the Ushabti were designed as the Pyramid's hands:\nembodied instruments of cosmic law sent into the world to do what a fixed stone\nstructure cannot. Their later generations received genuine autonomous will — the Seal\nCollege concluded that a judge incapable of weighing unforeseen circumstances cannot\nserve justice. The Solar Court has since collapsed, leaving the Ushabti without\ninstitutional authorization, without a hierarchy to report to. They continue anyway,\nserving a vision of cosmic law that outlasted the civilization that commissioned them,\neach variance from formal doctrine recorded in the inscriptions of their own stone bodies.\n
