329	scan	0	SCAN	SCAN reports the (seen) characters or mobiles surrounding the player.\nScan tells you the direction and the people situation that way, if any.\nUseful for checking about you in unknown circumstances.
330	communication	-1	communication	\n\t\t\t--COMMUNICATION--\nThe following commands are available:\nauction         gossip          newbie          invasion\nquestion        answer          flame           zzz\nshout           yell            pemote          emote\npose            say             tell            bug             idea\ntypo            read            write           clan\nrace            music           tongue          pray\nFor more detailed help, type "HELP <command>".\n
331	shieldblock	0	shieldblock	Syntax: shieldblock\n\nPrepares an active shield block, improving your armor class for a period\nof combat rounds. Shieldblock is a Warrior-line finisher skill: it can only\nbe activated when your combo counter has reached the required threshold\nduring active combat.\n\nEffects when activated:\n  - Grants a -1 AC (armor class) bonus for (combo_count - 3) combat rounds.\n    Lower AC makes you harder to hit.\n  - The combo counter is reset after activation.\n  - Skill proficiency improves on successful use.\n\nYou must be using a shield to get full benefit from this skill. Shieldblock\nis available to Warden, Knight, Paladin, Crusader, and other classes that\ntrain defensive techniques.\n\nRequirements:\n  - Must be in combat.\n  - Requires a valid finisher combo count (combo threshold met).\n  - Must have the skill learned.\n\nSee also: shelp shieldblock chiblock riposte parry dodge\n
372	seal_testimony	0	seal testimony	@@ySeal Testimony@@W                                       Sentinel level 50\n\nSyntax: seal testimony\n\nPreserve your current testimony marks against disruption. For 3 rounds:\n  * Stun effects reduce testimony by only 1 mark instead of half.\n  * Target-switch penalty reduced to losing 2 marks instead of full reset.\n  * Flee/recall and target death still reset marks fully.\n\n@@yDetails:@@W\n  * Mana cost: 10\n  * Requires at least 1 testimony mark.\n  * Cannot stack.\n\nUse this in long boss fights where a stun at 7+ marks would devastate your\nverdict setup. The Tribunal sealed records against tampering — this is that\npractice applied to your accumulated observations.\n\nSee also: @@msentinel testimony verdict@@W\n
332	house	1	house	Basic House (includes recall, 3 rooms, all indoors): 100 QP\n\n \n\nSpouse Recall Set to House: 75 QP\n\n***Areas***\n\n \n\nSlums: No extra Cost (Default)\n\nRich Section: 20 QP Extra\n\nNon-racial City (Tarot City, Tirna O'goth, etc): 10 QP Extra\n\n \n\n***Doors***\n\n \n\nLocked: 85 QP\n\nPick-proof: 85\n\nSmash-proof 85 QP\n\nPass-proof: 85 QP\n\nNodetect: 100 QP\n\n \n\n***Additional Rooms***\n\n \n\nFirst (total 4): 10 QP\n\nSecond (total 5): 20 QP\n\nThird (total 6): 30 QP\n\nFourth (total 7): 40 QP\n\nFifth (total 8): 50 QP\n\nSixth (total 9): 60 QP\n\nSeventh (total 10): 70 QP\n\nNOTE:NO house will be built with more than 10 rooms!\n\n \n\n***Room Flags***\n\n \n\nCold: 55 QP\n\nDark: 55 QP\n\nHot: 55 QP\n\nNo_magic: 60 QP\n\nNo_mob: 70 QP\n\nNo_recall: 55 QP\n\nNo_teleport: 60 QP\n\nPk: 70 QP\n\nPrivate: 60 QP\n\nQuiet: 55 QP\n\nRegen: 100 QP\n\nSafe: 80 QP\n\nSolitary: 50 QP\n\n \n\nPrices for room flags are PER room.\n\n \n\nAll rooms are defaulted indoors, but rooms can be outdoors if\n\nrequested.\n\nPlease contact staff if you have questions, or wish to\n\npurchase a home.\n\nCHANGE: Locks cost 15, not 85 QP\n\n
