415	2654	equipment druidic satchel	The equipment is centuries old, the remnants of a druidic monitoring station\nthat predates the confusion mists. The stone mortar was used for grinding\nmedicinal bark, and the herb bundles, though desiccated, still carry a faint\nscent of the deep-forest preparations that Kiess healers still use to treat\nmist-fever. The leather satchel has composted almost entirely, its contents\nreturned to the earth.\n
