1	shelp_armor	-1	armor	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Armor\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_DEFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 5\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: You feel less protected.\nAcquisition:\n   - Magi: level 3\nDescription:\n   Armor is a protective/support spell that strengthens, restores, or safeguards the target.\n*******************************************************************************\n
2	shelp_architecture_scan	-1	architecture scan	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Architecture Scan\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_SELF\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 8\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: You no longer perceive structural magical patterns.\nAcquisition:\n   - Psionicist: level 7\nDescription:\n   Architecture Scan is a psionic detection ability that allows the\n   Psionicist to perceive the magical structure of their surroundings and\n   any enchantments present. The psionicist extends their mental senses\n   to detect the structural patterns of magical constructs, effectively\n   granting a form of magical sight similar to detect magic but filtered\n   through a psionic framework.\n\n   While Architecture Scan is active, the Psionicist can see magical\n   auras on objects, rooms, and characters, and gains additional\n   information about the nature and intensity of magical effects they\n   encounter. This is the Psionicist's equivalent of the Magi's detect\n   magic but derived from mental perception rather than arcane theory.\n*******************************************************************************\n
3	shelp_elemental_confluence	-1	elemental confluence	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Elemental Confluence\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 200\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: elemental confluence\n   Wear-Off: None\nAcquisition:\n   - Grand Magi: level 18\nDescription:\n   Elemental Confluence is the Grand Magi capstone spell -- the ultimate\n   expression of the Convergence Codices' four-domain simultaneous\n   invocation. It unleashes fire, storm, tide, and stone in a single\n   devastating attack that combines all four elemental domains.\n\n   Damage formula: 300 + dice(highest_caster_level / 2, 25)\n   Damage elements: Fire + Air + Water + Earth (all four)\n   Mana cost: 200\n\n   This represents the "convergent phenomena that neither methodology alone\n   could produce" -- the pinnacle of Grand Magi practice where formal proof\n   methodology and elemental synthesis methodology illuminate each other\n   beyond what either achieves alone.\n*******************************************************************************\n
4	shelp_high_explosive	-1	high explosive	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: High Explosive\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 0\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: high explosive ammo\n   Wear-Off: !High Explosive Ammo!\nAcquisition:\n   - Not learnable by player classes.\nDescription:\n   High Explosive is an offensive spell used to damage an enemy target with direct magic.\n*******************************************************************************\n
5	shelp_breath_of_endurance	-1	breath of endurance	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Breath of Endurance\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 0\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: Your breath of endurance fades.\nAcquisition:\n   - Martial Artist: level 10\nDescription:\n   Breath of Endurance channels chi into sustained breath control, applying\n   a heal-over-time (HOT) effect and an AC bonus for several rounds. This\n   represents the Monk tradition's contribution to the Martial Artist\n   synthesis -- making Brawler ferocity sustainable through disciplined\n   internal energy management.\n\n   Chi cost: 8 (doubled to 16 if on cooldown via chi_skill_cost)\n   Cooldown: 15 rounds\n   Duration: 2 + (Martial Artist level / 5) rounds\n   HOT modifier: Monk level + Brawler level + (Martial Artist level * 3)\n   AC modifier: -(Martial Artist level * 5 + Monk level * 2)\n\n   Distinct from Chakra (burst heal + damroll) and Iron Skin (passive, no\n   chi cost). Breath of Endurance is sustained recovery + damage mitigation.\n*******************************************************************************\n
6	shelp_enhanced_sword_critical	-1	enhanced sword critical	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Enhanced Sword Critical\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 0\n Wait Beats: 0\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: !Enhanced Sword Critical!\nAcquisition:\n   - Swordsman: level 40\nDescription:\n   Enhanced Sword Critical improves sword users' critical chance and critical multiplier.\n*******************************************************************************\n
