19	shelp_chi_surge	-1	chi surge	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Chi Surge\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 80\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: chi surge\n   Wear-Off: None\nAcquisition:\n   - Martial Artist: level 5\nDescription:\n   Chi Surge channels all accumulated chi into a single devastating strike.\n   Requires a minimum of 10 chi to activate. All current chi is consumed,\n   and the damage of the strike scales directly with the amount of chi spent.\n\n   This is the Martial Artist's burst-damage counterpart to Flurry. Where\n   Flurry converts chi into many weak basic hits, Chi Surge converts chi\n   into one massive blow -- Monk internal energy directed through Brawler\n   impact methodology.\n\n   Chi cost: ALL current chi (minimum 10)\n   Cooldown: 15 rounds\n   Damage element: Physical\n   Damage formula: base pug damage * (chi spent / 5)\n*******************************************************************************\n
