22	shelp_predictive_collapse	-1	predictive collapse	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Predictive Collapse\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 150\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: predictive collapse\n   Wear-Off: Your combat patterns stabilize.\nAcquisition:\n   - Kinetimancer: level 15\nDescription:\n   Predictive Collapse is the Kinetimancer's apex technique -- modeling\n   the opponent's response patterns in real time and collapsing their\n   combat effectiveness before they can act. Deals heavy damage and\n   applies both hitroll and damroll debuffs.\n\n   Damage: dice(Kinetimancer + Necromancer + Egomancer levels, 10)\n   Damage elements: Mental + Shadow\n   Duration: 2 + (Kinetimancer level / 5) rounds\n   Hitroll penalty: -(Kinetimancer level * 3)\n   Damroll penalty: -(Kinetimancer level * 2)\n   Mana cost: 150\n\n   Explicitly named in the lore as high-level Kinetimancer practice:\n   "using real-time cognitive modeling of the opponent's response patterns\n   to identify the optimal moments and vectors for entropy-based momentum\n   redirection, then applying entropy effects that are precisely calibrated\n   to the opponent's anticipated responses."\n*******************************************************************************\n
