49	shelp_rune_poison	-1	rune:poison	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Rune:poison\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 80\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: The rune dissipates.\nAcquisition:\n   - Warlock: level 8\n   - Assassin: level 38\n   - Necromancer: level 40\nDescription:\n   Rune:poison Places a poison rune trap that triggers on intruders and inflicts toxic harm.\n*******************************************************************************\n
50	shelp_mana_barrier	-1	mana barrier	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Mana Barrier\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_SELF\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 30\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage:\n   Wear-Off: !Mana Barrier!\nAcquisition:\n   - Magi: level 25\nDescription:\n   Mana Barrier condenses raw magical energy into a protective shield\n   around the caster. For a duration of level/4 rounds, applies an armor\n   class bonus (-15 - level/10) and a saving throw improvement (-level/8).\n   The dual protection covers both physical strikes and incoming spells.\n   Cannot be stacked. Combines well with Stone Skin and other defensive\n   buffs to give the Magi meaningful survivability in direct combat.\n*******************************************************************************\n
51	shelp_reach_silence	-1	reach silence	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Reach Silence\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 1\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: reach silence\n   Wear-Off: !Reach Silence!\nAcquisition:\n   - Cipher: level 30\nDescription:\n   Reach Silence loops a wire or cord around the victim's throat while\n   attacking from stealth. Named for the Saltglass Reach corridors where\n   Cipher doctrine was first systematized, the technique requires the\n   Cipher to be hiding or sneaking before the attack is initiated. The\n   hold restricts breathing, applying AFF_HOLD for 2 rounds and dealing\n   damage scaled to Cipher level. Breaks the caster out of hiding and\n   initiates combat engagement with the target.\n*******************************************************************************\n
52	shelp_animate	-1	animate	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Animate\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 50\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: !Animate!\nAcquisition:\n   - Necromancer: level 70\n   - Egomancer: level 70\nDescription:\n   Animate Animates a corpse into an undead servant under the caster's control.\n*******************************************************************************\n
53	shelp_disarm	-1	disarm	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Disarm\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 1\n Wait Beats: 18\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: !Disarm!\nAcquisition:\n   - Warden: level 12\n   - Cipher: level 53\nDescription:\n   Disarm attempts to knock an opponent's weapon out of their hands and briefly prevents immediate re-equipping.\n*******************************************************************************\n
54	shelp_invis	-1	invis	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Invis\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 5\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: You are no longer invisible.\nAcquisition:\n   - Magi: level 17\nDescription:\n   Invis Makes the target invisible until the effect is broken, allowing safer scouting, escapes, or setup before combat.\n*******************************************************************************\n
55	shelp_charge	-1	charge	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Charge\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 1\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: Charge\n   Wear-Off: !Charge\nAcquisition:\n   - Knight: level 30\n   - Swordsman: level 30\n   - Paladin: level 89\n   - Priest: level 89\nDescription:\n   Charge is a direct momentum attack in the warrior combo toolkit, used to engage hard and contribute to finisher and combo setup.\n*******************************************************************************\n
56	shelp_read_intent	-1	read intent	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Read Intent\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 0\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage:\n   Wear-Off: !Read Intent!\nAcquisition:\n   - Cipher: level 18\nDescription:\n   Read Intent studies an opponent's body language and fighting patterns,\n   granting the Cipher improved evasion in the upcoming exchange. On\n   success, applies a dodge bonus (level/4) and an armor class improvement\n   (-level/5) for a duration of 5 + Cipher level/10 rounds. The insight\n   into enemy movements allows the Cipher to avoid incoming strikes more\n   effectively. No effect if used out of combat context.\n   Syntax: read intent\n*******************************************************************************\n
