59	shelp_cone_of_cold	-1	cone of cold	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Cone Of Cold\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 100\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: Cone of Cold\n   Wear-Off: !Cone of Cold!\nAcquisition:\n   - Sorcerer: level 56\nDescription:\n   Cone Of Cold is an offensive spell that inflicts cold damage on an enemy target.\n*******************************************************************************\n
103	shelp_healing_light	-1	healing light	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Healing Light\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 150\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: @@NThe @@mHealing Light@@N dissipates.\nAcquisition:\n   - Priest: level 11\n   - Paladin: level 42\nDescription:\n   Healing Light Bathes the target in restorative holy light to recover hit points.\n*******************************************************************************\n
