144	shelp_greensight	-1	greensight	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: greensight\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_SELF\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n    HP Cost: 15\n Wait Beats: 12\n  Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: \nAcquisition:\n   - Druid: level 42\nDescription:\n   Grants infravision and detect hidden.\n*******************************************************************************\n
156	shelp_shield_block	-1	shield block	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Shield Block\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 0\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: !Shield Block!\nAcquisition:\n   - Pugilist: level 18\n   - Warden: level 40\nDescription:\n   Shield Block gives you a chance to block incoming attacks when using a shield or buckler.\n*******************************************************************************\n
145	shelp_sanctified_strike	-1	sanctified strike	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Sanctified Strike\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 80\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: sanctified strike\n   Wear-Off: None\nAcquisition:\n   - Templar: level 15\nDescription:\n   Sanctified Strike delivers a melee attack infused with holy power that\n   simultaneously heals the Templar for a portion of the damage dealt. This\n   represents the integrated combat-and-consecration methodology that\n   emerged from the garrison crisis -- "striking techniques that\n   incorporated consecration effects."\n\n   Costs: Movement (via subtract_energy_cost)\n   Cooldown: 15 rounds\n   Damage element: Physical + Holy\n   Damage formula: war_attack base * (10 + Templar level) / 10\n   Self-heal: damage dealt / 5\n\n   Distinct from Holystrike (pure holy damage, combo-compatible). Sanctified\n   Strike trades combo integration for self-sustain, reflecting the\n   Templar's dual-function doctrine.\n*******************************************************************************\n
146	shelp_dirt	-1	dirt	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Dirt\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 1\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: !dirt!\nAcquisition:\n   - Warden: level 35\n   - Cipher: level 36\n   - Pugilist: level 47\nDescription:\n   Dirt attempts to blind an opponent by kicking dirt into their eyes.\n*******************************************************************************\n
