150	shelp_summon_devourer	-1	summon devourer	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Summon Devourer\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 1200\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: None\nAcquisition:\n   - Not learnable by player classes.\nDescription:\n   Summon Devourer Summons a devourer servant that excels at aggressive pressure and sustained melee support.\n*******************************************************************************\n
