204	shelp_cripple	-1	cripple	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Cripple\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 80\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: Cripple\n   Wear-Off: You are no longer crippled!\nAcquisition:\n   - Assassin: level 89\n   - Warlock: level 92\nDescription:\n   Cripple is an execution-style debuff that consumes poison effects on the target and converts them into a short but potent penalty to the victim's resistance/saving power.\n*******************************************************************************\n
205	shelp_steal	-1	steal	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Steal\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 1\n Wait Beats: 18\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: steal\n   Wear-Off: !steal!\nAcquisition:\n   - Cipher: level 20\nDescription:\n   Steal is a thieving utility skill for lifting coins or items from NPCs, with success based on dexterity, level difference, and situational risk.\n*******************************************************************************\n
206	shelp_holystrike	-1	holystrike	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Holystrike\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 80\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: Holystrike\n   Wear-Off: !Holystrike!\nAcquisition:\n   - Knight: level 29\n   - Paladin: level 44\nDescription:\n   Holystrike is a combat skill that attacks an enemy and deals holy-type physical or energy damage.\n*******************************************************************************\n
207	shelp_adrenaline	-1	adrenaline	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Adrenaline\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 0\n Wait Beats: 0\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: !ADRENALINE!\nAcquisition:\n   - Knight: level 21\n   - Swordsman: level 21\n   - Monk: level 28\n   - Brawler: level 28\n   - Paladin: level 42\n   - Priest: level 42\nDescription:\n   Adrenaline grants bonus damroll after the character takes damage above a\n   threshold, creating a reactive damage spike effect in sustained combat.\n*******************************************************************************\n
