209	shelp_remove_curse	-1	remove curse	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Remove Curse\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_DEFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 5\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: !Remove Curse!\nAcquisition:\n   - Cleric: level 27\n   - Magi: level 36\nDescription:\n   Remove Curse is a protective/support spell that strengthens, restores, or safeguards the target.\n*******************************************************************************\n
210	shelp_cognitive_disruption	-1	cognitive disruption	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Cognitive Disruption\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 120\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: cognitive disruption\n   Wear-Off: Your concentration returns.\nAcquisition:\n   - Kinetimancer: level 12\nDescription:\n   Cognitive Disruption scatters the target's concentration, dealing mental\n   damage and applying a saving-spell penalty that makes them more\n   vulnerable to subsequent magical effects.\n\n   Damage: dice(Kinetimancer level + Egomancer level, 8)\n   Damage element: Mental\n   Duration: 1 + (Kinetimancer level / 10) rounds\n   Saving spell penalty: +(Kinetimancer level * 3)\n   Mana cost: 120\n\n   The lore describes redirecting cognitive momentum to "disrupt the\n   directional coherence of the momentum so it cannot focus effectively."\n   This is the Kinetimancer's control spell -- softening targets for\n   follow-up magical attacks.\n*******************************************************************************\n
211	shelp_holy_wrath	-1	holy wrath	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Holy Wrath\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 140\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: Holy Wrath\n   Wear-Off: !Holy Wrath!\nAcquisition:\n   - Priest: level 40\n   - Paladin: level 80\nDescription:\n   Holy Wrath is an offensive spell that inflicts holy damage on an enemy target.\n*******************************************************************************\n
212	shelp_holy_avenger	-1	holy avenger	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Holy Avenger\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 1200\n Wait Beats: 24\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: !HOLY AVENGER!\nAcquisition:\n   - Paladin: level 76\n   - Priest: level 76\nDescription:\n   Holy Avenger Calls down holy wrath against evil-aligned foes and is especially effective when used by righteous casters.\n*******************************************************************************\n
213	shelp_equip_wand	-1	equip wand	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Equip Wand\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 0\n Wait Beats: 0\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: !Equip Wand!\nAcquisition:\n   - Sorcerer: level 1\n   - Necromancer: level 1\n   - Wizard: level 1\n   - Priest: level 1\n   - Egomancer: level 1\nDescription:\n   Equip Wand allows you to equip items flagged as wands; without it, wand-type equipment cannot be worn.\n*******************************************************************************\n
214	shelp_cloak_mental	-1	cloak:mental	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Cloak:mental\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_DEFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 550\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: @@NThe @@mcloak@@N around your body fades.\nAcquisition:\n   - Monk: level 48\nDescription:\n   Cloak:mental is the Monk's signature remort cloak. It surrounds the caster\n   in a shimmering aura of mental fortitude, providing a flat reduction to all\n   incoming non-physical (magical) damage. The reduction amount is equal to\n   pseudo_level / 2.\n\n   For example, at pseudo-level 100, every magical hit against the Monk is\n   reduced by 50 damage. This reduction is applied before other damage\n   modifiers such as elemental resistance.\n\n   The cloak does not affect physical damage. For physical damage reduction,\n   see cloak:iron (Knight).\n\n   Duration scales with pseudo-level (pseudo_level / 8 rounds).\n*******************************************************************************\n
215	shelp_know_weakness	-1	know weakness	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Know Weakness\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_SELF\n   Position: POS_STANDING\n   Min Mana: 15\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: You are less aware of your enemy's weaknesses.\nAcquisition:\n   - Psionicist: level 18\nDescription:\n   Know Weakness is a protective/support spell that strengthens, restores, or safeguards the target.\n*******************************************************************************\n
216	shelp_feeble_mind	-1	feeble mind	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Feeble Mind\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 12\n Wait Beats: 18\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: None\n   Wear-Off: You are now thinking quickly.\nAcquisition:\n   - Necromancer: level 45\nDescription:\n   Feeble Mind is an offensive spell that inflicts psychic damage on an enemy target.\n*******************************************************************************\n
217	shelp_harm	-1	harm	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Harm\n       Kind: Spell\n     Target: TAR_CHAR_OFFENSIVE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 35\n Wait Beats: 12\n Can Learn: TRUE\nNoun Damage: harm spell\n   Wear-Off: !Harm!\nAcquisition:\n   - Cleric: level 74\nDescription:\n   Harm is an offensive spell used to damage an enemy target with direct magic.\n*******************************************************************************\n
218	shelp_measured_response	-1	measured response	*******************************************************************************\n       Name: Measured Response\n       Kind: Skill\n     Target: TAR_IGNORE\n   Position: POS_FIGHTING\n   Min Mana: 0\n Wait Beats: 0\n Can Learn: FALSE\nNoun Damage: measured response\n   Wear-Off: !Measured Response!\nAcquisition:\n   - Sentinel: level 30\nDescription:\n   Measured Response is a passive combat philosophy mastered by senior\n   Sentinels. Rather than reacting emotionally or instinctively to attacks,\n   the Sentinel evaluates each incoming strike and responds with calculated\n   precision. This discipline reduces the Sentinel's susceptibility to\n   feints and distractions while improving counter-attack timing.\n\n   The passive benefit of Measured Response improves the Sentinel's ability\n   to land retaliatory attacks after successfully defending. When the Sentinel\n   blocks, parries, or evades an incoming blow, Measured Response triggers\n   a follow-up counter-attack at improved accuracy. The skill embodies the\n   Sentinel doctrine that every defensive action should create an offensive\n   opportunity.\n*******************************************************************************\n
